{
  "posts": [
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gal-bad7f89950",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gal",
      "text": "白い服の日に限ってリップ落とすのなんで\n襟元見て発狂した",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gal-d23c0e350d",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gal",
      "text": "カバンの中で化粧水あふれてた\n中ぐちゃぐちゃ、最悪",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gal-5f76d47fec",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gal",
      "text": "今日のコーデ、靴だけ浮いてるの後から気づいた\n写真残してしまった",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gal-7ac0106488",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gal",
      "text": "眉毛整えすぎた\n別人すぎて笑えない",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gal-4bca70684a",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gal",
      "text": "カラー剤の匂いが服についてて一日中気になる\n自分だけかもなのに気になる",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gal-af44e67529",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gal",
      "text": "ヘアオイルつけすぎて頭ぴかぴか\n電車の窓に映って発覚",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-work-43e84f7334",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "work",
      "text": "返信したつもりが下書きのまま残ってた\n相手どう思ってるんだろ",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-work-bdd783d8f3",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "work",
      "text": "会議室予約、終了時間だけ押してなかった\n次の人来て発覚",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-work-df24d14700",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "work",
      "text": "チャットの「了解です」打ちすぎて指が痛い\n今日の成果これだけかも",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-work-b9fd5e5e3f",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "work",
      "text": "Excelのフィルタ解除忘れて数字おかしく見えてた\n一瞬で焦った",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-work-fcb18140a8",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "work",
      "text": "画面共有で別タブ映った気がする\n確認する勇気がない",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-work-b204a31f23",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "work",
      "text": "自分のカメラオフ忘れて変顔映ってた説ある\n誰も指摘してこないの逆に怖い",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gym-dadaac78cc",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gym",
      "text": "脚トレ後に階段登れなくて後輩に先に行かれた\nきつい…",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gym-5db42bd91a",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gym",
      "text": "腹筋ローラー、3回で人生終了した\n床に伏せたまましばらく動けず",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gym-81164bc79a",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gym",
      "text": "プロテインシェイカー洗わず放置してた\n蓋開けた瞬間終わった",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gym-f57d9a53bd",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gym",
      "text": "自宅トレ用マット、畳む気力がない\n床に出したまま翌日",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gym-d95db6e6e4",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gym",
      "text": "ランニングマシン速度上げすぎて降りられない\n緊急停止した",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-gym-509ce5b15a",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "gym",
      "text": "今日は歩くだけでトレ扱いする日\nそれでいい日もある",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-nonsense-4c3d7db972",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "nonsense",
      "text": "傘、晴れだと忘れる雨だと持ってない\n法則すぎる",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-nonsense-8eb5432376",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "nonsense",
      "text": "エレベーターで押されてるボタンもう一回押してる\n押したあとの気まずい感じなんとかして",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-nonsense-3eb7970a14",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "nonsense",
      "text": "シャンプーとリンス、また順番逆\n気づくのいつも途中",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-nonsense-1fc97904c3",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "nonsense",
      "text": "靴下のゴムだけ先に寿命迎えてる\nかかと落ちる",
      "source": "chitchat_gen",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T12:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cas-gen-nonsense-b5d7e77903",
      "topic": "雑談",
      "kind": "casual",
      "theme": "nonsense",
      "text": "カバンの中でイヤホン絡まりすぎ問題\n毎朝の儀式",
